{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux经GDB CAP_SYS_PTRACE发起root网络连接。对应需求：安全检测。官方：Root Network Connection via GDB CAP_SYS_PTRACE。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.network*","logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux经GDB CAP_SYS_PTRACE发起root网络连接","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"28bc620d-b2f7-4132-b372-f77953881d05","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 安全检测","来源: 默认","对应需求: 安全检测"],"type":"eql","query":"sequence by host.id, process.entry_leader.entity_id with maxspan=30s\n  [process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action == \"exec\" and process.name == \"gdb\" and\n   (process.thread.capabilities.effective : \"CAP_SYS_PTRACE\" or process.thread.capabilities.permitted : \"CAP_SYS_PTRACE\") and\n   user.id != \"0\"]\n  [network where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.action == \"connection_attempted\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n   process.name != null and user.id == \"0\"]\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux经GDB CAP_SYS_PTRACE发起root网络连接\n\n### 为何重要\n可能表示异常活动\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1055","name":"Process Injection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1055.008","name":"Ptrace System Calls","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/008/"}]},{"id":"T1068","name":"Exploitation for Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1068/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.004","name":"Unix Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1071","name":"Application Layer Protocol","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1055","name":"Process Injection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1055.008","name":"Ptrace System Calls","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/008/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":8,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
